# Read-Only Catalogue API — Local Test Requests
# Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or copy into curl/Postman).
# Start the app first: dotnet run --project "Assignment 2/Assignment 2.csproj" -- web
@host = http://localhost:5108

### 1. List catalogue (paged, default pageSize=12)
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue

### 2. Filter by type
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue?type=Book

### 3. Filter by name (partial, case-insensitive)
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue?name=gatsby

### 4. Filter by status
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue?status=Available

### 5. Pagination
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue?page=2&pageSize=2

### 6. Single item by library code -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue/BOOK001

### 7. Missing item -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue/NOPE999

### 8. Invalid page -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue?page=0

### 9. Invalid type -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue?type=Gadget

### 10. Oversized pageSize -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/catalogue?pageSize=999

### 11. Write attempts are rejected -> 405 Method Not Allowed
POST {{host}}/api/catalogue
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"x"}

### 12. DELETE is rejected -> 405
DELETE {{host}}/api/catalogue/BOOK001
